  "agent_notes": [
    "Official HTE search identified PageId 32067 for the Jhunjhunu campus and PageId 32073 for a separate Nawalgarh campus; only PageId 32067 was used.",
    "The official Courses page lists 12 programme families and explicitly states 03 Year Duration for UG Semester I-VI and 02 Year Duration for PG Semester I-IV. No official eligibility statements were found, so eligibility fields are null.",
    "The official catalogue is internally inconsistent: the homepage displays BCA Part I, while the Courses page and 2026-27 UG Admission page do not list BCA; the current UG Admission page lists BA, BCOM, BSC and BBA.",
    "The History and Departments pages mention Computer Application and Sociology in UG, but do not provide consistent current course/admission catalogue entries; they were not added as separate courses.",
    "The official 2026-27 prospectus page linked a PDF that returned 404 during this run, so catalogue completeness remains partial and the record requires manual review.",
    "The managed proxy produced the exact self-signed certificate-chain error on initial normal-TLS search requests; curl --insecure was used only for public requests to expected search and Rajasthan HTE hosts."
  ]
